  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut the potato into wedges. Place on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333068b6fc1706b348d97e/step-6ff0b886.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potato is roasting, cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. Thinly slice the brown onion.\n• Slice the cucumber into thin sticks. Roughly chop the cos lettuce (see ingredients). Roughly chop the tomato.\n• TIP: Soaking the haloumi helps mellow out the saltiness!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333068b6fc1706b348d97e/step-86dbf36c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium heat. Cook the haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Remove from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333068b6fc1706b348d97e/step-d75004d7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return the pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add the onion and cook, stirring , until softened, 5-6 minutes. Add the balsamic vinegar, water and brown sugar and stir well to combine. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Season and transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333068b6fc1706b348d97e/step-ae484092.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the haloumi is cooking, heat the mini flour tortillas on a plate in the microwave for 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333068b6fc1706b348d97e/step-601495fa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring everything to the table to serve. Build your tacos by spreading the tortillas with a layer of creamy pesto dressing, then filling with cos lettuce, roasted potato, haloumi, caramelised onion, cucumber and tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333068b6fc1706b348d97e/step-fda27958.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
